  TA::STORE[0] x
1. tie the temporary proxy $a[0]:
  TS::TIESCALAR
  TA::FETCH[0]
   read $a[0] afresh: x
2. tie a held proxy, then three reads, a write, a read:
  TS::TIESCALAR
   read 1:   TS::FETCH
  TA::FETCH[0]
x
   read 2:   TS::FETCH
from-TS
   read 3:   TS::FETCH
from-TS
   write 'w':
  TS::STORE w
  TA::STORE[0] w
   read 4:   TS::FETCH
  TA::FETCH[0]
w
  TA::FETCH[0]
   read $a[0] afresh: w
3. weaken the held, doubly magical proxy, then kill the referent (both ties keep weak copies):
  TS::STORE ref
  TA::STORE[0] ref
   weaken:
   undef the referent:
  DESTROY
  TS::STORE undef
  TA::STORE[0] undef
  TS::FETCH
  TA::FETCH[0]
   read after the kill: undef
end
